# --- Local backups / secret-bearing artifacts (2026-09-13) -----------------
# Never commit: these contain real API keys or are throwaway restore copies.
# NOTE: the `*.bak` rule above does NOT match them — they end with a timestamp
# suffix (e.g. `.env.bak-20260907`), not with `.bak`.
.env.bak-*
.fix-backup-*/
*.c1-backup
restart-freellmapi.ps1.bak-*
server/dist.bak-*/

